      "content": "That makes sense. I've been hearing a lot about how these \"reshoring\" trends are basically a response to how much control international bodies and massive global corporations have over local economies. Do you think there's a legitimate case for countries pulling back from those big multilateral agreements to protect their own sovereignty, or is that just a recipe for economic instability?",
